WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.289
Step 1. Select the prescription.

1.2
00:00:02.289 --> 00:00:07.261
You can change the note of a medicine or remove a medicine entered by mistake,

1.3
00:00:07.261 --> 00:00:11.138
but you cannot add medicines to a saved prescription.

2.1
00:00:11.138 --> 00:00:13.705
Step 2. Open the form. Select Edit.

2.2
00:00:13.705 --> 00:00:18.867
Care opens the Medication Request form with the medicines of the prescription,

2.3
00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:22.411
and the note of the prescription is read-only.

3.1
00:00:22.411 --> 00:00:25.131
Step 3. Change the note of a medicine.

3.2
00:00:25.131 --> 00:00:28.901
The saved medicines are read-only, except for their notes.

3.3
00:00:28.901 --> 00:00:33.236
Enter or change the text in the note field of the medicine.

4.1
00:00:33.236 --> 00:00:36.604
Step 4. Remove a medicine entered by mistake.

4.2
00:00:36.604 --> 00:00:40.207
Select Medication actions, then Remove, and confirm.

4.3
00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:46.043
Care keeps the medicine on the prescription with the status Entered in Error.

5.1
00:00:46.043 --> 00:00:49.540
Step 5. Save the changes. Select Save Changes.

5.2
00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:55.259
Care shows Questionnaire submitted successfully and saves only the medicines that

5.3
00:00:55.259 --> 00:00:56.606
you changed.
